T* (TASK: Build the complete Vocabulary Builder & Spaced Repetition \(SRS\) engine.) Tj
T* (REQUIREMENTS:) Tj
T* (1. Implement the SuperMemo SM-2 algorithm in /src/lib/srs.js:) Tj
T* (   - Calculate interval \(I\), repetition count \(n\), and ease factor \(EF\) based on user recall grade \(0 = complete blackout to 5 =) Tj
T* (perfect recall\).) Tj
T* (   - Compute next review due date and retention strength percentage.) Tj
T* (2. Build /src/components/vocabulary/VocabularySection.jsx featuring:) Tj
T* (   a\) Daily Review Queue: Displays cards due for review today.) Tj
T* (   b\) Flashcard Player: 3D flip card animation showing term, phonetics, audio, example sentence, and recall rating buttons) Tj
T* (\(Again, Hard, Good, Easy\).) Tj
T* (   c\) Master Word Deck: Searchable, filterable table of all saved words with mastery indicators.) Tj
T* (   d\) "Add to Vocabulary" action: Wire this up across Culture Explorer, Translator, and Lessons so any highlighted word can) Tj
T* (be saved with one tap.) Tj
T* (3. Provide offline caching via IndexedDB/localStorage so flashcard reviews can be completed without internet connectivity.) Tj
T* (VERIFICATION: Test SM-2 mathematical intervals with unit tests; verify card flipping and database sync.) Tj
