(Act as the Lead Linguistic Tooling Engineer for UniLang.) Tj
T* (TASK: Build the Interactive Grammar Coach & Conjugation Engine in /src/components/grammar/GrammarSection.jsx.) Tj
T* (REQUIREMENTS:) Tj
T* (1. Build dynamic verb conjugation tables for regular and irregular verbs across Present, Preterite, Imperfect, Future,) Tj
T* (Conditional, and Subjunctive tenses for Spanish, French, Italian, German, and Portuguese.) Tj
T* (2. Create an interactive "Sentence Analyzer" input where learners type or paste a sentence in the target language:) Tj
T* (   - Send input to POST /api/ai/analyze-grammar \(implementing Prompt 3.2 from UNILANG-ARCH-2026-V1\).) Tj
T* (   - Display colored token badges for each part of speech \(Subject, Verb, Object, Preposition\).) Tj
T* (   - Flag grammatical errors with clear linguistic explanations and one-click corrections.) Tj
T* (3. Build a curated Grammar Rule Library organized by CEFR levels \(e.g. "Ser vs Estar", "Subjunctive Mood Triggers",) Tj
T* ("Direct vs Indirect Pronoun Order"\).) Tj
T* (VERIFICATION: Verify conjugation accuracy against standard linguistic models; ensure sentence parser catches tense and) Tj
T* (gender agreement errors.) Tj
